<title>HONG KONG: MIT (Holdings) 1996 net rises 121 pct.</title>
<headline>MIT (Holdings) 1996 net rises 121 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   13.29	vs 6.01</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  13.86 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    19.67	vs 8.89</p>
<p>    Turnover		     543.46     vs 475.65</p>
<p>    Company name		 Management Investment &amp; Technology</p>
<p>				     (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 19-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Management Investment &amp; Technology is a smoke detector manufacturer.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$21.02 million on disposal of 50 percent interest in certain subsidiaries, loss of HK$5.02 million on provision for doubtful receivables and loss of HK$2.15 million on write-off of deferred value-added tax assets.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is five H.K. cents vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
